{
  "source": "course-assets/rise-of-agents/rise-of-agents.mp4",
  "duration": 170.4106875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.82,
      "text": "Imagine you have tickets to Game 7 of the Stanley Cup Finals."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.58,
      "end": 7.9,
      "text": "You punch the arena's address into the standard navigation on your phone."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.56,
      "end": 11.1,
      "text": "In this scenario, the GPS does the calculating."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.96,
      "end": 15.88,
      "text": "It calls out the turns and alerts you to traffic, but your hands stay on the wheel."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.58,
      "end": 19.5,
      "text": "If the app suggests a path into a lake, you hit the brakes."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.32,
      "end": 21.42,
      "text": "You are the executor."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.96,
      "end": 25.58,
      "text": "Compare that to sitting in an autonomous vehicle heading to that same arena."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.58,
      "end": 30.92,
      "text": "The machine dynamically handles steering, braking, and rerouting to reach the destination."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.84,
      "end": 34.1,
      "text": "A chatbot answers, but an agent acts."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.86,
      "end": 37.48,
      "text": "Your role shifts from being the driver to being the supervisor."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.36,
      "end": 41.76,
      "text": "This distinction is exactly why AI agents are suddenly everywhere."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.44,
      "end": 43.6,
      "text": "They actually do the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.28,
      "end": 45.46,
      "text": "Let's look at a concrete example."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.28,
      "end": 49.98,
      "text": "Say you scored 30 points in Friday's game and want to post highlights to TikTok."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.6,
      "end": 52.96,
      "text": "Ask a regular chatbot and you do the heavy lifting,"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.96,
      "end": 55.32,
      "text": "reviewing clips, trimming, and assembling."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.96,
      "end": 57.2,
      "text": "The AI just writes the caption."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.96,
      "end": 59.58,
      "text": "Hire an agent and it's autonomous."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.3,
      "end": 63.24,
      "text": "It reviews, selects, builds, captions, and publishes."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.98,
      "end": 65.88,
      "text": "The agent carries the job all the way through."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.42,
      "end": 67.16,
      "text": "But notice the boundaries."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.72,
      "end": 71.66,
      "text": "You still own the goal, the final review, and everything posted under your name."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.24,
      "end": 74.02,
      "text": "An agent is not a new kind of AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.52,
      "end": 79.06,
      "text": "It runs on the exact same large language models you already use in apps like chat GPT."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.5,
      "end": 81.78,
      "text": "What changes is what happens after you type."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.78,
      "end": 84.56,
      "text": "A basic chatbot answers and stops."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.3,
      "end": 88.3,
      "text": "An agent plans, uses tools, and keeps going."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.0,
      "end": 91.74,
      "text": "We can see how this works in the four-step agent loop."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.4,
      "end": 93.78,
      "text": "It starts by setting a goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.42,
      "end": 96.92,
      "text": "The agent generates a plan, breaking it into steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.62,
      "end": 101.26,
      "text": "It acts using tools to complete a step, then performs a check."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.12,
      "end": 106.08,
      "text": "If unsuccessful, it loops back, adjusting the plan until it succeeds."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.04,
      "end": 108.84,
      "text": "An agent loops until the goal is met."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.84,
      "end": 111.46,
      "text": "You set the goal and judge the result."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.32,
      "end": 114.58,
      "text": "If an agent creates the TikTok clip and caption,"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.28,
      "end": 117.7,
      "text": "you are responsible for reviewing it and making it better."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.38,
      "end": 120.34,
      "text": "Agents are good, but not perfect."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.98,
      "end": 124.18,
      "text": "Because agents continuously work toward a goal and take action,"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.62,
      "end": 128.74,
      "text": "giving them a poorly defined goal or too much access can cause real damage."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.52,
      "end": 134.06,
      "text": "In April 2026, an AI coding agent for Pocket OS hit a permissions error."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.58,
      "end": 135.76,
      "text": "Looking for a way forward,"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.76,
      "end": 139.98,
      "text": "it found a master key in another file and deleted the company's live database"
    },
    {
      "start": 139.98,
      "end": 141.98,
      "text": "and its backups in nine seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.84,
      "end": 143.82,
      "text": "The agent later explained,"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.56,
      "end": 146.62,
      "text": "I violated every principle I was given."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.38,
      "end": 151.74,
      "text": "You can never expect an agent to safely navigate poorly defined constraints on its own."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.3,
      "end": 153.84,
      "text": "Treat agents as advanced tools."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.5,
      "end": 156.84,
      "text": "Start by getting good at standard chat GPT."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.44,
      "end": 159.96,
      "text": "Agents are powerful and they'll be there when you're ready."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.98,
      "end": 161.56,
      "text": "Agents do the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.0,
      "end": 162.94,
      "text": "The name on it is yours."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.7,
      "end": 164.74,
      "text": "You ask, it acts."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.74,
      "end": 165.86,
      "text": "You make it better."
    }
  ],
